WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.551
Skrivist Comics. Read comics panel by panel.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:08.725
It finds the panels on every page and guides you through them, one at a time.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:16.132
Detection runs right in your browser, so your comics never leave your device.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:20.409
Connect your Armarium server, and your whole collection is there.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:26.116
Your place syncs through Armarium. Stop on your laptop, and carry on from your phone.

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.434
Skrivist Comics. Free, in your browser.
